# The bot's direction on the radar's rim (game/minimap.h, minimap_direction): an orange arrowhead
# outside the rim, turning with the view. The bot starts 2000 to the player's right. The player
# turns right, right (a U-turn), then left; 1 s apart. The debug text's last line is the bot.
wait 21
shot mark_1
press right
wait 1
shot mark_2
press right
wait 1
shot mark_3
press left
wait 1
shot mark_4
wait 2
shot mark_5
wait 2
shot mark_6
